Z||000000||Philphine||09-29-2001||11:27 PM||||<BR>from about 12:00 till 8:00pm i was in the back yard fiberglassing. i get so few phone calls that i didn't bother with having a phone nearby. took a short drive, got some food and got home. just before ten there a short news blurb for the news coming up. <P>"and at standiford field preparations are made as the air guard is called to active duty".<P>      !<P>"hey, gimme the phone"<P>checking messages. none. call the shop. no one there. ok, thats normal. just wait for the news. turns out it's just some of the special force guys.<P>whew.<P>------------------<BR>Phil T.<P>start where you are,<BR>use what you have,<BR>do what you can.||||reg||1
